  description: '1 LIGHT monster + 2 monsters, except on the field or in the GY

    This
    Fusion Summoned card cannot be destroyed by battle. As long as no monsters on
    your field or GY share an original name with any monster on your opponent''s
    field or GY, monsters you control cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can
    send from your hand, Deck, or Extra Deck to the GY, 1 monster with the same original
    name as a monster on your opponent''s field or GY, then target 1 monster on their
    field or GY; banish it.'
